{
  "lineCounts": {
    "Julie": 7,
    "Parvaneh": 7,
    "Player": 7,
    "Xudong": 39
  },
  "subQuests": [
    {
      "subId": "7217005",
      "subQuestName": "",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "721700501"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "721700501": {
            "id": "721700501",
            "speakerId": 20268,
            "speakerName": "Xudong",
            "text": "The Seagrass here is pretty good...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721700502"
            ]
          },
          "721700502": {
            "id": "721700502",
            "speakerId": 20270,
            "speakerName": "Parvaneh",
            "text": "I wouldn't call this \"picking Seagrass.\" It's more like \"pulling Seagrass\"...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721700503"
            ]
          },
          "721700503": {
            "id": "721700503",
            "speakerId": 20269,
            "speakerName": "Julie",
            "text": "If we used a small knife, we'd get them all in no time."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7217001",
      "subQuestName": "",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "721700101"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "721700101": {
            "id": "721700101",
            "speakerId": 20268,
            "speakerName": "Xudong",
            "text": "We can't go down there like this...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721700102"
            ]
          },
          "721700102": {
            "id": "721700102",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "What happened?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721700103"
            ]
          },
          "721700103": {
            "id": "721700103",
            "speakerId": 20268,
            "speakerName": "Xudong",
            "text": "Traveler, we meet again! We're currently trying to figure out how to... dive into the waters in front of us.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721700104"
            ]
          },
          "721700104": {
            "id": "721700104",
            "speakerId": 20268,
            "speakerName": "Xudong",
            "text": "We're going to grab ourselves some fresh Seagrass to make something known as \"Onigiri.\"",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721700106",
              "721700108"
            ]
          },
          "721700106": {
            "id": "721700106",
            "speakerId": 20268,
            "speakerName": "Xudong",
            "text": "We could, but the Seagrass there generally isn't that fresh. There's always a little something missing in the flavor of dishes you make that way.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721700109"
            ]
          },
          "721700109": {
            "id": "721700109",
            "speakerId": 20268,
            "speakerName": "Xudong",
            "text": "I've asked around, and the locals say that good-quality Seagrass grows down here.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721700110"
            ]
          },
          "721700110": {
            "id": "721700110",
            "speakerId": 20268,
            "speakerName": "Xudong",
            "text": "But when we arrived today, we found that it had been completely flooded with seawater.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721700111"
            ]
          },
          "721700111": {
            "id": "721700111",
            "speakerId": 20268,
            "speakerName": "Xudong",
            "text": "Even worse, none of us have any skill in diving, so we can only watch this all play out...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721700112"
            ]
          },
          "721700112": {
            "id": "721700112",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Are there any related mechanisms nearby?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721700113"
            ]
          },
          "721700113": {
            "id": "721700113",
            "speakerId": 20269,
            "speakerName": "Julie",
            "text": "There's one over there...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721700114"
            ]
          },
          "721700114": {
            "id": "721700114",
            "speakerId": 20268,
            "speakerName": "Xudong",
            "text": "But it's stuck inside that barrier again, so we can't get in.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721700115"
            ]
          },
          "721700115": {
            "id": "721700115",
            "speakerId": 20268,
            "speakerName": "Xudong",
            "text": "*sigh* We'll continue trying to figure this out...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721700116"
            ]
          },
          "721700116": {
            "id": "721700116",
            "speakerId": 20268,
            "speakerName": "Xudong",
            "text": "Still, Traveler, do tell us if you know anything about how to solve this problem.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721700117"
            ]
          },
          "721700117": {
            "id": "721700117",
            "speakerId": 20268,
            "speakerName": "Xudong",
            "text": "Of course, it would be best if you could just bring the Seagrass to us directly—",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721700118"
            ]
          },
          "721700118": {
            "id": "721700118",
            "speakerId": 20270,
            "speakerName": "Parvaneh",
            "text": "Mr. Xudong?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721700119"
            ]
          },
          "721700119": {
            "id": "721700119",
            "speakerId": 20268,
            "speakerName": "Xudong",
            "text": "*cough* I mean, you will be well-compensated if you could bring us the Seagrass directly! I'll add on a great feast of Onigiri as further incentive!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721700120"
            ]
          },
          "721700120": {
            "id": "721700120",
            "speakerId": 20270,
            "speakerName": "Parvaneh",
            "text": "Onigiri, \"a great feast,\" pick one...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721700121"
            ]
          },
          "721700121": {
            "id": "721700121",
            "speakerId": 20268,
            "speakerName": "Xudong",
            "text": "Oh, come on, we just need to make more... *cough* Oh fine, fine. Let's keep trying to figure it out, shall we?"
          },
          "721700108": {
            "id": "721700108",
            "speakerId": 20268,
            "speakerName": "Xudong",
            "text": "Seagrass found by the seaside generally isn't that fresh. There's always a little something missing in the flavor of dishes you make that way."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7217002",
      "subQuestName": "Pick Fresh Seagrass",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "721700201"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "721700201": {
            "id": "721700201",
            "speakerId": 20268,
            "speakerName": "Xudong",
            "text": "Have you gathered any Seagrass, Traveler?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721700202"
            ]
          },
          "721700202": {
            "id": "721700202",
            "speakerId": 20268,
            "speakerName": "Xudong",
            "text": "Aha, yes, this is it. Thanks for your help, Traveler!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721700203"
            ]
          },
          "721700203": {
            "id": "721700203",
            "speakerId": 20268,
            "speakerName": "Xudong",
            "text": "Well, time to make that dish that they call... Onigiri, was it? I've heard that it's a simple enough dish to make...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721700204"
            ]
          },
          "721700204": {
            "id": "721700204",
            "speakerId": 20268,
            "speakerName": "Xudong",
            "text": "Alright, hang on while I prepare the food. It's going to take a while."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7217003",
      "subQuestName": "Bring the Fresh Seagrass to Xudong",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [],
        "dialogs": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7217004",
      "subQuestName": "Talk to Xudong",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "721700301"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "721700301": {
            "id": "721700301",
            "speakerId": 20268,
            "speakerName": "Xudong",
            "text": "Now then. Seagrass... Fish... and Rice...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721700302"
            ]
          },
          "721700302": {
            "id": "721700302",
            "speakerId": 20268,
            "speakerName": "Xudong",
            "text": "This should be how it goes...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721700303"
            ]
          },
          "721700303": {
            "id": "721700303",
            "speakerId": 20268,
            "speakerName": "Xudong",
            "text": "Yup, that should be it! I present to you all, the Onigiri!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721700304"
            ]
          },
          "721700304": {
            "id": "721700304",
            "speakerId": 20270,
            "speakerName": "Parvaneh",
            "text": "How very... plain. Well, I'll take this one. I doubt I could finish any more...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721700305"
            ]
          },
          "721700305": {
            "id": "721700305",
            "speakerId": 20269,
            "speakerName": "Julie",
            "text": "Well, I say it's all good as long it tastes good! I'll have this one!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721700306"
            ]
          },
          "721700306": {
            "id": "721700306",
            "speakerId": 20268,
            "speakerName": "Xudong",
            "text": "This serving's yours, Traveler — and of course, here's a copy of the recipe.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721700307"
            ]
          },
          "721700307": {
            "id": "721700307",
            "speakerId": 20268,
            "speakerName": "Xudong",
            "text": "They seem like the most simple thing in the world, these Onigiri, but there's some real technique to making them well.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721700308"
            ]
          },
          "721700308": {
            "id": "721700308",
            "speakerId": 20268,
            "speakerName": "Xudong",
            "text": "Well then. I should have some myself. All that work's made me hungry...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721700309"
            ]
          },
          "721700309": {
            "id": "721700309",
            "speakerId": 20268,
            "speakerName": "Xudong",
            "text": "Hey, Parvaneh, I thought you said you couldn't finish!? Leave some for me, come on!"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7217004",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "721700401"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "721700401": {
            "id": "721700401",
            "speakerId": 20268,
            "speakerName": "Xudong",
            "text": "Are we really going to have to find a way to dive down there?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721700402"
            ]
          },
          "721700402": {
            "id": "721700402",
            "speakerId": 20270,
            "speakerName": "Parvaneh",
            "text": "Can't we switch locations? Do we really have to get our Seagrass here...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721700403"
            ]
          },
          "721700403": {
            "id": "721700403",
            "speakerId": 20269,
            "speakerName": "Julie",
            "text": "Oh, come on, why does that mechanism have to be inside that barrier again..."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7217006",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "721700601"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "721700601": {
            "id": "721700601",
            "speakerId": 20269,
            "speakerName": "Julie",
            "text": "Hmm... There wouldn't be any ruins beneath this place by any chance, right?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721700602"
            ]
          },
          "721700602": {
            "id": "721700602",
            "speakerId": 20270,
            "speakerName": "Parvaneh",
            "text": "R—Ruins? Well, it certainly would be nice if there were..."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7217007",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "721700701"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "721700701": {
            "id": "721700701",
            "speakerId": 20268,
            "speakerName": "Xudong",
            "text": "It looks like the area below has been flooded before...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721700702"
            ]
          },
          "721700702": {
            "id": "721700702",
            "speakerId": 20269,
            "speakerName": "Julie",
            "text": "Yup, and the water marks very obvious, too. This place was definitely flooded up till not long ago.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721700703"
            ]
          },
          "721700703": {
            "id": "721700703",
            "speakerId": 20269,
            "speakerName": "Julie",
            "text": "But why did the water suddenly retreat...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721700704"
            ]
          },
          "721700704": {
            "id": "721700704",
            "speakerId": 20270,
            "speakerName": "Parvaneh",
            "text": "Ugh, this place is all wet. The water's going to get into my shoes...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721700705"
            ]
          },
          "721700705": {
            "id": "721700705",
            "speakerId": 20268,
            "speakerName": "Xudong",
            "text": "Well, forget it. Let's just gather some Seagrass as quickly as we can.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721700706"
            ]
          },
          "721700706": {
            "id": "721700706",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "What are you doing over here?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721700707"
            ]
          },
          "721700707": {
            "id": "721700707",
            "speakerId": 20268,
            "speakerName": "Xudong",
            "text": "Oh? Would you look at that! So we meet again, Traveler.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721700708"
            ]
          },
          "721700708": {
            "id": "721700708",
            "speakerId": 20268,
            "speakerName": "Xudong",
            "text": "We just went down to collect some Fresh Seagrass to make a dish known as Onigiri. It was pretty tough going down there. My shoes are soaked...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721700709"
            ]
          },
          "721700709": {
            "id": "721700709",
            "speakerId": 20268,
            "speakerName": "Xudong",
            "text": "But that aside, Traveler, could you help us get some more Seagrass?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721700710"
            ]
          },
          "721700710": {
            "id": "721700710",
            "speakerId": 20268,
            "speakerName": "Xudong",
            "text": "The area below seems to have been flooded not long ago, and while the water has retreated, there's no telling when it might come rushing back in again.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721700711"
            ]
          },
          "721700711": {
            "id": "721700711",
            "speakerId": 20268,
            "speakerName": "Xudong",
            "text": "As such, I think it might be best to gather a bit more Seagrass as quickly as we can.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721700713",
              "721700716"
            ]
          },
          "721700713": {
            "id": "721700713",
            "speakerId": 20268,
            "speakerName": "Xudong",
            "text": "We're counting on you, Traveler.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721700714"
            ]
          },
          "721700714": {
            "id": "721700714",
            "speakerId": 20268,
            "speakerName": "Xudong",
            "text": "Once you've gathered the Seagrass, please bring them back to me."
          },
          "721700716": {
            "id": "721700716",
            "speakerId": 20268,
            "speakerName": "Xudong",
            "text": "We could, but the Seagrass there generally isn't that fresh. There's always a little something missing in the flavor from dishes you make that way.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721700717"
            ]
          },
          "721700717": {
            "id": "721700717",
            "speakerId": 20268,
            "speakerName": "Xudong",
            "text": "The quality of the Seagrass here should be superior by far. Either way, we'll need your help, Traveler.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721700718"
            ]
          },
          "721700718": {
            "id": "721700718",
            "speakerId": 20268,
            "speakerName": "Xudong",
            "text": "Once you've gathered the Seagrass, please bring them back to me."
          }
        }
      }
    }
  ]
}